{"strongs": "H8064", "word": "שָׁמַי", "translit": "sha.ma.yim", "root": "שמי", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "heavens, sky", "definition": "[ שָׁמַי ] noun masculine Deut 33:28 only plural שָׁמַ֫יִם 421 ( Sta §324 a ) heavens, sky (Late Hebrew id. ; Assyrian šamû plural šamê, šamûtu , also šamâmu , compare Phoenician שמם ; Sabean סמה Hom Chr 46, 124 ; Arabic Ethiopic Aramaic שְׁמַיָּא ; Palmyrene, Nabataean שמ(י)ן in proper name (compounded with בעל ) Lzb 153 GACooke 45 ; on plural form see Ba ZMG xiii (1888), 341 f. ); — absolute ׳ שׁ Gen 1:1 +, מָ֑יִם - Gen 2:4 +; הַשָּׁמַ֫יְמָה Exod 9:8 +; construct שְׁמֵי Deut 10:14 + 9 t.; suffix שָׁמֶיךָ Ps 8:4 +2 t., שָׁמָיו Deut 33:28 , שְׁמֵיכֶם Lev 26:19 , with verb plural, Hos 2:23 — 1. a. visible heavens, sky , where stars, etc., are Judg 5:20 ; Gen 15:5 ( J ), Deut 4:19 ; Gen 1:14 ; Gen 1:15 ; Gen 1:17 ( P ), hence ׳ כּוֺכְבֵי הַשּׁ Gen 22:17 ( J E ) = 9 t. (usually as countless), ׳ (כָּלֿ) צְבָא הַשּׁ Deut 4:19 ; Jer 8:2 + ( ׳ צ 1 c ; rarely of angels , ׳ צ 1 b ; before which fowl fly Gen 1:20 ( P ), compare Deut 4:17 ; Jer 8:7 ; Prov 30:19 , ׳ עוֺף הַשּׁ Gen 2:19 ( J ), Gen 1:19 ( P ) + ( עוֺף 1 ), ׳ צִפֹּר שׁ Ps 8:9 , ׳ נִשְׁרֵי שׁ Lam 4:19 as רָקִיע (q. v.) Gen 1:8 ( P ), Ps 19:2 , with waters beneath and above Gen 1:9 ( P , compare v Gen 1:7 ), Ps 148:4 , darkened with clouds 1Kgs 18:45 , cleared by wind Job 26:13 whence comes rain Gen 8:2 ( J ), Judg 5:4 ; Deut 11:11 +, and dew Gen 27:28 ( J ), v Gen 27:39 ( E ), Deut 33:28 (poem) +. compare ׳ בִּרְכֹת שׁ Gen 49:25 (poem in J ), ׳ מֶגֶר שׁ Deut 33:13 (poem), but also (destructive) fire 2Kgs 1:10 (twice in verse); Job 1:16 + (see also 2 a below); ׳ הֹבְרֵישׁ Isa 47:13 , i.e. astrologers, compare ׳ אוֺתוֺתהַשּׁ Jer 10:2 as high Gen 11:4 ( J ), Amos (:2 (opposed to שְׁאוֺל ), v Gen 11:6 (opposed to אֶרֶץ ) +, ׳ עַדלֵֿב הַשּׁ Deut 4:11 as over all the earth, ׳ תַּחַת (כָּלֿ)הַשּׁ Gen 6:17 ; Gen 7:19 (both P ), Deut 2:25 ; Eccl 1:13 ׳ מִתַּחַת וגו (of extermination) Exod 17:14 ( E ), Deut 7:24 ; Deut 9:14 +; specifically of Israel, שָׁמֶיךָ Deut 28:23 , שְׁמֵיכֶם Lev 26:19 ( H ); וּבֵין הָאָרֶץ ׳ בֵּין הַשּׁ 2Sam 18:9 (hung from tree), 1Chr 21:16 (of angel), compare Ezek 8:3 (Ezekiel in vision), Zech 5:9 (flying ephah); וְעַדקְֿצֵה ׳ מִקְּצֵה הַשּׁ ׳ הַשּׁ of limits of horizon Deut 4:32 , compare Deut 30:4 ; Neh 1:9 ; Ps 19:7 as made by God Jer 51:15 (opposed to תֵּבֵל ), Ps 8:4 + enduring Deut 11:21 ; Job 14:12 ; Ps 89:30 especially וְ(הָ)אָרֶץ ׳ (הַ)שּׁ = universe (compare in Sabean, SabDenkm No.41.42, l.3 ) Deut 3:24 ; Gen 1:1 ( P ) + (especially Deuteronomy, Isa 2 , Psalms), + הַיָם Exod 20:11 ; Hag 2:6 , etc., + מַיִם מִתַּחַת לָאָרֶץ Exod 20:4 = Deut 5:8 ,.compare Prov 30:4 , etc.; opposed to תְּהוֺם Prov 8:27 (+ אֶרֶץ v Prov 8:29 ) חֲרָשִׁים וְהָאָרֶץ חֲרָשָׁה ׳ שׁ as part of future glory Isa 65:17 ; Isa 66:22 . \\ \\ b. phrases are: ׳ אֲרֻבּוֺת הַשּׁ (letting rain through) Gen 7:11 ; Gen 8:2 ( P ), Mal 3:10 (figurative), compare ׳ בַּשּׁ ׳ א ׳ הֲיַעֲשֶׂה י 2Kgs 7:2 ; 2Kgs 7:19 , so ׳ דַּלְתֵי שׁ Ps 78:23 (for manna), compare ׳ דְָּגַן שׁ , v Ps 78:24 , ׳ לֶחֶם שׁ Ps 105:40 ׳ מוֺסְדוֺת הַשּׁ 2Sam 22:8 (|| הָאָרֶץ ; in || Ps 18:8 חָרִים ׳ מ ), ׳ עַמּוּרֵי שׁ Job 26:11 , ׳ חוּג שׁ Job 22:14 towards the sky is הַשָּׁמַ֫יְמָה Josh 8:20 ( J ), Exod 9:8 ; Exod 9:10 ( P ), Job 2:12 ; Judg 13:20 ; Judg 20:40 ; 2Chr 6:13 עַלהַֿשָּׁמַיִם Exod 9:22 ; Exod 9:23 ; Exod 10:21 ; Exod 10:22 (all E ), ׳ אֶלשֿׁ Deut 32:40 (poem), Dan 12:7 , ׳ שׁ alone 1Kgs 8:22 ; 1Kgs 8:54 ; Job 35:5 ; Prov 23:5 . 2. a. as abode of God ( ׳ י ) 1Kgs 8:30 ; 1Kgs 8:32 + often, where he sits enthroned Ps 2:3 ; Isa 66:1 , etc., compare ׳ רֹכֵבשׁ Deut 33:26 (poem), Ps 68:34 , whence he rains brimstone Gen 19:24 ( J ), bread Exod 16:4 ( E ), compare Neh 9:15 , casts hailstones Josh 11:11 ( E ), talks with Israel Exod 20:22 ( E ; Gi v Exod 20:19 ) +, compare Gen 21:17 ; Gen 22:11 ; Gen 22:15 ( E ), looks down Deut 26:15 +, hears his people Ps 20:7 + 10 t. Chronicles, etc.; he thunders ׳ בַּשּׁ 1Sam 2:10 ; Ps 18:14 ,|| ׳ מִןשֿׁ 2Sam 22:14 he bends ( נטה ) ׳ שׁ to come down v 2Sam 22:10 = Ps 18:10 , compare Ps 144:5 and ( rend ) Isa 63:19 ׳ נִפְּתְּחוּ הַשּׁ Ezek 1:1 in vision of God, compare ׳ שַׁעַר הַשּׁ Gen 28:17 ( E ; + בֵּית אֱלֹהִים ); though even ׳ שְׁמֵי הַשּׁ the highest heuvens cannot hold him Deut 10:14 ; 1Kgs 8:27 2 Chron 6:18, 2Chr 2:5 ; Neh 9:6 ; Ps 148:4 , שְׁמֵי שְׁמֵיקֶֿדֶם Ps 68:34 he is called ׳ אֱלֹהֵי הַשּׁ (post-exilic title) Ezra 1:2 = 2Chr 36:23 + 11 t. Ezra Nehemiah; Jonah 1:9 (compare Aramaic, Dan 2:18 ; Dan 2:19 ; Dan 2:37 ; Dan 2:44 in Gen 24:7 add with ᵐ5 וֵאלֹהֵי הָאָרֶץ , as v Gen 24:3 ), ׳ אֵלהַֿשׁ Ps 136:26 his sword is ׳ בַּשׁ Isa 34:5 , but also his חֶסֶד Ps 36:6 , צֶדֶק Ps 85:12 , אֱמוּנָח Ps 89:3 , his word fixed Ps 119:89 . — ׳ שׁ are שָׁמָיו (of Israel) Deut 33:28 (poem), שְׁמֵיכֶם Lev 26:19 שָׁמֶיךָ Ps 8:4 ; Ps 144:5 , ׳ שְׁמֵי י Lam 3:66 , קָדְשׁוֺ ׳ שׁ Ps 20:7 . \\ \\ b. Elijah taken up ׳ הַשּׁ in whirlwind 2Kgs 2:1 , compare v 2Kgs 2:11 . 3. ׳ הַשּׁ personified in various relations Isa 1:2 ; Jer 2:12 ; Job 15:15 ; Ps 19:2 ; Ps 50:6 = Ps 97:6 ; Ps 89:6 ; Ps 148:4 . 4. מְלֶכֶת ׳ הַשּׁ see ׳ מ p. 573. I, II. שַׁמָּה see שׁמם . שָׂ֫מָּה see שָׁם .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8792')\">BDB8792</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H8064')\">H8064</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8791')\">BDB8791</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8793')\">BDB8793</entry></div><p> [<bdbheb>שָׁמַי</bdbheb>]<b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Deut 33:28\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(5,33,28)\">Deut 33:28</ref></sup> only plural <bdbheb>שָׁמַ֫יִם</bdbheb><sub>421</sub> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sta')\">Sta<sup>§324 a</sup></lookup>) <highlightword>heavens, sky</highlightword> (Late Hebrew <highlight>id.</highlight>; Assyrian <transliteration><highlight>šamû</highlight></transliteration> plural <transliteration><highlight>šamê, šamûtu</highlight></transliteration>, also <transliteration><highlight>šamâmu</highlight></transliteration>, compare Phoenician <bdbheb>שמם</bdbheb>; Sabean <bdbheb>סמה</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hom')\">Hom<sup>Chr 46, 124</sup></lookup>; Arabic <placeholder5602/> Ethiopic <placeholder5603/> Aramaic <bdbarc>שְׁמַיָּא</bdbarc> <placeholder5604/>; Palmyrene, Nabataean <bdbheb>שמ(י)ן</bdbheb> in proper name (compounded with <bdbheb>בעל</bdbheb>) <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ldzb')\">Lzb<sup>153</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Cooke')\">GACooke<sup>45</sup></lookup>; on plural form see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ba')\">Ba<sup>ZMG xiii (1888), 341 f.</sup></lookup>); — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 1:1\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(1,1,1)\">Gen 1:1</ref> +, <bdbheb>מָ֑יִם</bdbheb>- <ref ref=\"Gen 2:4\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(1,2,4)\">Gen 2:4</ref> +; <bdbheb>הַשָּׁמַ֫יְמָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 9:8\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(2,9,8)\">Exod 9:8</ref> +; construct <bdbheb>שְׁמֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 10:14\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(5,10,14)\">Deut 10:14</ref> + 9 t.; suffix <bdbheb>שָׁמֶיךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 8:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,8,4)\">Ps 8:4</ref> +2 t., <bdbheb>שָׁמָיו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 33:28\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(5,33,28)\">Deut 33:28</ref>, <bdbheb>שְׁמֵיכֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 26:19\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(3,26,19)\">Lev 26:19</ref>, with verb plural, <ref ref=\"Hos 2:23\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(28,2,23)\">Hos 2:23</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1. a.</b> <highlight>visible heavens, sky</highlight>, where stars, etc., are <ref ref=\"Judg 5:20\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(7,5,20)\">Judg 5:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 15:5\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(1,15,5)\">Gen 15:5</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Deut 4:19\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,19)\">Deut 4:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 1:14\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(1,1,14)\">Gen 1:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 1:15\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(1,1,15)\">Gen 1:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 1:17\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(1,1,17)\">Gen 1:17</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), hence <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כּוֺכְבֵי הַשּׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 22:17\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(1,22,17)\">Gen 22:17</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup><lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>) = 9 t. (usually as countless), <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>(כָּלֿ) צְבָא הַשּׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 4:19\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,19)\">Deut 4:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 8:2\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(24,8,2)\">Jer 8:2</ref> + ( <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>צ</bdbheb> <b>1 c</b>; <highlightword>rarely of angels</highlightword>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>צ</bdbheb> <b>1 b</b>; <highlightword>before which fowl fly</highlightword> <ref ref=\"Gen 1:20\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(1,1,20)\">Gen 1:20</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), compare <ref ref=\"Deut 4:17\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,17)\">Deut 4:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 8:7\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(24,8,7)\">Jer 8:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 30:19\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(20,30,19)\">Prov 30:19</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עוֺף הַשּׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 2:19\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(1,2,19)\">Gen 2:19</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Gen 1:19\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(1,1,19)\">Gen 1:19</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>) + (<bdbheb>עוֺף</bdbheb> <b>1</b>), <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>צִפֹּר שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 8:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,8,9)\">Ps 8:9</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נִשְׁרֵי שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lam 4:19\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(25,4,19)\">Lam 4:19</ref> as <bdbheb>רָקִיע</bdbheb> (q. v.) <ref ref=\"Gen 1:8\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(1,1,8)\">Gen 1:8</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Ps 19:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,19,2)\">Ps 19:2</ref>, with waters beneath and above <ref ref=\"Gen 1:9\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(1,1,9)\">Gen 1:9</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>, compare v<ref ref=\"Gen 1:7\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(1,1,7)\">Gen 1:7</ref>), <ref ref=\"Ps 148:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"148\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"148\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,148,4)\">Ps 148:4</ref>, darkened with clouds <ref ref=\"1Kgs 18:45\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"45\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"45\" onclick=\"bcv(11,18,45)\">1Kgs 18:45</ref>, cleared by wind <ref ref=\"Job 26:13\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(18,26,13)\">Job 26:13</ref> whence comes rain <ref ref=\"Gen 8:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,8,2)\">Gen 8:2</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Judg 5:4\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(7,5,4)\">Judg 5:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 11:11\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(5,11,11)\">Deut 11:11</ref> +, and dew <ref ref=\"Gen 27:28\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(1,27,28)\">Gen 27:28</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), v<ref ref=\"Gen 27:39\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(1,27,39)\">Gen 27:39</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Deut 33:28\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(5,33,28)\">Deut 33:28</ref> (poem) +. compare <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בִּרְכֹת שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 49:25\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(1,49,25)\">Gen 49:25</ref> (poem in <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מֶגֶר שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 33:13\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(5,33,13)\">Deut 33:13</ref> (poem), but also (destructive) fire <ref ref=\"2Kgs 1:10\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(12,1,10)\">2Kgs 1:10</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Job 1:16\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(18,1,16)\">Job 1:16</ref> + (see also <b>2 a</b> below); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הֹבְרֵישׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 47:13\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(23,47,13)\">Isa 47:13</ref>, i.e. astrologers, compare <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אוֺתוֺתהַשּׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 10:2\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(24,10,2)\">Jer 10:2</ref> as high <ref ref=\"Gen 11:4\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(1,11,4)\">Gen 11:4</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), Amos (:2 (opposed to <bdbheb>שְׁאוֺל</bdbheb>), v<ref ref=\"Gen 11:6\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(1,11,6)\">Gen 11:6</ref> (opposed to <bdbheb>אֶרֶץ</bdbheb>) +, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עַדלֵֿב הַשּׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 4:11\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,11)\">Deut 4:11</ref>as over all the earth, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>תַּחַת (כָּלֿ)הַשּׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 6:17\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(1,6,17)\">Gen 6:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 7:19\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(1,7,19)\">Gen 7:19</ref> (both <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Deut 2:25\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(5,2,25)\">Deut 2:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Eccl 1:13\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(21,1,13)\">Eccl 1:13</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מִתַּחַת וגו</bdbheb> (of extermination) <ref ref=\"Exod 17:14\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(2,17,14)\">Exod 17:14</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Deut 7:24\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(5,7,24)\">Deut 7:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 9:14\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(5,9,14)\">Deut 9:14</ref> +; specifically of Israel, <bdbheb>שָׁמֶיךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 28:23\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(5,28,23)\">Deut 28:23</ref>, <bdbheb>שְׁמֵיכֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 26:19\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(3,26,19)\">Lev 26:19</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('H')\"><reflink>H</reflink></lookup>); <bdbheb>וּבֵין הָאָרֶץ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בֵּין הַשּׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 18:9\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(10,18,9)\">2Sam 18:9</ref> (hung from tree), <ref ref=\"1Chr 21:16\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(13,21,16)\">1Chr 21:16</ref> (of angel), compare <ref ref=\"Ezek 8:3\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(26,8,3)\">Ezek 8:3</ref> (Ezekiel in vision), <ref ref=\"Zech 5:9\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(38,5,9)\">Zech 5:9</ref> (flying ephah); <bdbheb>וְעַדקְֿצֵה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מִקְּצֵה הַשּׁ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַשּׁ</bdbheb> of limits of horizon <ref ref=\"Deut 4:32\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,32)\">Deut 4:32</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Deut 30:4\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(5,30,4)\">Deut 30:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 1:9\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(16,1,9)\">Neh 1:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 19:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,19,7)\">Ps 19:7</ref> as made by God <ref ref=\"Jer 51:15\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(24,51,15)\">Jer 51:15</ref> (opposed to <bdbheb>תֵּבֵל</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Ps 8:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,8,4)\">Ps 8:4</ref> + enduring <ref ref=\"Deut 11:21\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(5,11,21)\">Deut 11:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 14:12\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(18,14,12)\">Job 14:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 89:30\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,30)\">Ps 89:30</ref> especially<bdbheb>וְ(הָ)אָרֶץ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>(הַ)שּׁ</bdbheb> = universe (compare in Sabean, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('SabDenkm')\">SabDenkm<sup>No.41.42, l.3</sup></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Deut 3:24\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(5,3,24)\">Deut 3:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 1:1\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(1,1,1)\">Gen 1:1</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>) + (especially Deuteronomy, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Isa')\">Isa<sup>2</sup></lookup>, Psalms), + <bdbheb>הַיָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 20:11\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(2,20,11)\">Exod 20:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hag 2:6\" b=\"37\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(37,2,6)\">Hag 2:6</ref>, etc., + <bdbheb>מַיִם מִתַּחַת לָאָרֶץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 20:4\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(2,20,4)\">Exod 20:4</ref>= <ref ref=\"Deut 5:8\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(5,5,8)\">Deut 5:8</ref>,.compare <ref ref=\"Prov 30:4\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(20,30,4)\">Prov 30:4</ref>, etc.; opposed to <bdbheb>תְּהוֺם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 8:27\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(20,8,27)\">Prov 8:27</ref> (+ <bdbheb>אֶרֶץ</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Prov 8:29\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(20,8,29)\">Prov 8:29</ref>) <bdbheb>חֲרָשִׁים וְהָאָרֶץ חֲרָשָׁה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> as part of future glory <ref ref=\"Isa 65:17\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"65\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"65\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(23,65,17)\">Isa 65:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 66:22\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"66\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"66\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(23,66,22)\">Isa 66:22</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> phrases are: <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אֲרֻבּוֺת הַשּׁ</bdbheb> (letting rain through) <ref ref=\"Gen 7:11\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(1,7,11)\">Gen 7:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 8:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,8,2)\">Gen 8:2</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Mal 3:10\" b=\"39\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(39,3,10)\">Mal 3:10</ref> (figurative), compare <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בַּשּׁ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הֲיַעֲשֶׂה י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 7:2\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(12,7,2)\">2Kgs 7:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 7:19\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(12,7,19)\">2Kgs 7:19</ref>, so <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>דַּלְתֵי שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 78:23\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"78\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"78\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(19,78,23)\">Ps 78:23</ref> (for manna), compare <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>דְָּגַן שׁ</bdbheb>, v<ref ref=\"Ps 78:24\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"78\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"78\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(19,78,24)\">Ps 78:24</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לֶחֶם שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 105:40\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"105\" vBegin=\"40\" cEnd=\"105\" vEnd=\"40\" onclick=\"bcv(19,105,40)\">Ps 105:40</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מוֺסְדוֺת הַשּׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 22:8\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(10,22,8)\">2Sam 22:8</ref> (|| <bdbheb>הָאָרֶץ</bdbheb>; in || <ref ref=\"Ps 18:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,18,8)\">Ps 18:8</ref> <bdbheb>חָרִים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb>), <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עַמּוּרֵי שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 26:11\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(18,26,11)\">Job 26:11</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>חוּג שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 22:14\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(18,22,14)\">Job 22:14</ref> <highlight>towards the sky</highlight> is <bdbheb>הַשָּׁמַ֫יְמָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 8:20\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(6,8,20)\">Josh 8:20</ref>(<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Exod 9:8\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(2,9,8)\">Exod 9:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 9:10\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(2,9,10)\">Exod 9:10</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Job 2:12\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(18,2,12)\">Job 2:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 13:20\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(7,13,20)\">Judg 13:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 20:40\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"40\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"40\" onclick=\"bcv(7,20,40)\">Judg 20:40</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 6:13\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(14,6,13)\">2Chr 6:13</ref> <bdbheb>עַלהַֿשָּׁמַיִם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 9:22\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(2,9,22)\">Exod 9:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 9:23\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(2,9,23)\">Exod 9:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 10:21\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(2,10,21)\">Exod 10:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 10:22\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(2,10,22)\">Exod 10:22</ref>(all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אֶלשֿׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 32:40\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"40\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"40\" onclick=\"bcv(5,32,40)\">Deut 32:40</ref> (poem), <ref ref=\"Dan 12:7\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(27,12,7)\">Dan 12:7</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> alone <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:22\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(11,8,22)\">1Kgs 8:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:54\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"54\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"54\" onclick=\"bcv(11,8,54)\">1Kgs 8:54</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 35:5\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(18,35,5)\">Job 35:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 23:5\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(20,23,5)\">Prov 23:5</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2. a.</b> <highlightword>as abode of God</highlightword> (<bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:30\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(11,8,30)\">1Kgs 8:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:32\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(11,8,32)\">1Kgs 8:32</ref> + often, where he sits enthroned <ref ref=\"Ps 2:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,2,3)\">Ps 2:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 66:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"66\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"66\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,66,1)\">Isa 66:1</ref>, etc., compare <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>רֹכֵבשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 33:26\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(5,33,26)\">Deut 33:26</ref>(poem), <ref ref=\"Ps 68:34\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"68\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"68\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(19,68,34)\">Ps 68:34</ref>, whence he rains brimstone <ref ref=\"Gen 19:24\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,24)\">Gen 19:24</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), bread <ref ref=\"Exod 16:4\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(2,16,4)\">Exod 16:4</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), compare <ref ref=\"Neh 9:15\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(16,9,15)\">Neh 9:15</ref>, casts hailstones <ref ref=\"Josh 11:11\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(6,11,11)\">Josh 11:11</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), talks with Israel <ref ref=\"Exod 20:22\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(2,20,22)\">Exod 20:22</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gi')\">Gi</lookup> v<ref ref=\"Exod 20:19\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(2,20,19)\">Exod 20:19</ref>) +, compare <ref ref=\"Gen 21:17\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(1,21,17)\">Gen 21:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 22:11\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(1,22,11)\">Gen 22:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 22:15\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(1,22,15)\">Gen 22:15</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), looks down <ref ref=\"Deut 26:15\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(5,26,15)\">Deut 26:15</ref> +, hears his people <ref ref=\"Ps 20:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,20,7)\">Ps 20:7</ref>+ 10 t. Chronicles, etc.; he thunders <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בַּשּׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 2:10\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(9,2,10)\">1Sam 2:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 18:14\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(19,18,14)\">Ps 18:14</ref>,|| <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מִןשֿׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 22:14\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(10,22,14)\">2Sam 22:14</ref> he bends (<bdbheb>נטה</bdbheb>) <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> to come down v<ref ref=\"2Sam 22:10\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(10,22,10)\">2Sam 22:10</ref>= <ref ref=\"Ps 18:10\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(19,18,10)\">Ps 18:10</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Ps 144:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"144\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"144\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,144,5)\">Ps 144:5</ref> and (<highlight>rend</highlight>) <ref ref=\"Isa 63:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"63\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"63\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(23,63,19)\">Isa 63:19</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נִפְּתְּחוּ הַשּׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 1:1\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(26,1,1)\">Ezek 1:1</ref> in vision of God, compare <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שַׁעַר הַשּׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 28:17\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(1,28,17)\">Gen 28:17</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>; + <bdbheb>בֵּית</bdbheb> <bdbheb>אֱלֹהִים</bdbheb>); though even <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שְׁמֵי הַשּׁ</bdbheb> <highlight>the highest heuvens</highlight> cannot hold him <ref ref=\"Deut 10:14\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(5,10,14)\">Deut 10:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:27\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(11,8,27)\">1Kgs 8:27</ref> 2 Chron 6:18, <ref ref=\"2Chr 2:5\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(14,2,5)\">2Chr 2:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 9:6\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(16,9,6)\">Neh 9:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 148:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"148\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"148\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,148,4)\">Ps 148:4</ref>, <bdbheb>שְׁמֵי שְׁמֵיקֶֿדֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 68:34\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"68\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"68\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(19,68,34)\">Ps 68:34</ref> he is called <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אֱלֹהֵי הַשּׁ</bdbheb> (post-exilic title) <ref ref=\"Ezra 1:2\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(15,1,2)\">Ezra 1:2</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 36:23\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(14,36,23)\">2Chr 36:23</ref> + 11 t. Ezra Nehemiah; <ref ref=\"Jonah 1:9\" b=\"32\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(32,1,9)\">Jonah 1:9</ref> (compare Aramaic, <ref ref=\"Dan 2:18\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,18)\">Dan 2:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 2:19\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,19)\">Dan 2:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 2:37\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,37)\">Dan 2:37</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 2:44\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"44\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"44\" onclick=\"bcv(27,2,44)\">Dan 2:44</ref> in <ref ref=\"Gen 24:7\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(1,24,7)\">Gen 24:7</ref> add with <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <bdbheb>וֵאלֹהֵי הָאָרֶץ</bdbheb>, as v<ref ref=\"Gen 24:3\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(1,24,3)\">Gen 24:3</ref>), <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אֵלהַֿשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 136:26\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"136\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"136\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(19,136,26)\">Ps 136:26</ref> his sword is <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בַּשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 34:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,34,5)\">Isa 34:5</ref>, but also his <bdbheb>חֶסֶד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 36:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,36,6)\">Ps 36:6</ref>, <bdbheb>צֶדֶק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 85:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"85\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"85\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,85,12)\">Ps 85:12</ref>, <bdbheb>אֱמוּנָח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 89:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,3)\">Ps 89:3</ref>, his word fixed <ref ref=\"Ps 119:89\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"89\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"89\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,89)\">Ps 119:89</ref>. — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> are <bdbheb>שָׁמָיו</bdbheb> (of Israel) <ref ref=\"Deut 33:28\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(5,33,28)\">Deut 33:28</ref> (poem), <bdbheb>שְׁמֵיכֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 26:19\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(3,26,19)\">Lev 26:19</ref> <bdbheb>שָׁמֶיךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 8:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,8,4)\">Ps 8:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 144:5\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"144\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"144\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(19,144,5)\">Ps 144:5</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שְׁמֵי י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lam 3:66\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"66\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"66\" onclick=\"bcv(25,3,66)\">Lam 3:66</ref>, <bdbheb>קָדְשׁוֺ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 20:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,20,7)\">Ps 20:7</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> Elijah taken up <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַשּׁ</bdbheb> in whirlwind <ref ref=\"2Kgs 2:1\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(12,2,1)\">2Kgs 2:1</ref>, compare v<ref ref=\"2Kgs 2:11\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(12,2,11)\">2Kgs 2:11</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַשּׁ</bdbheb> personified in various relations <ref ref=\"Isa 1:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,1,2)\">Isa 1:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 2:12\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(24,2,12)\">Jer 2:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 15:15\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(18,15,15)\">Job 15:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 19:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,19,2)\">Ps 19:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 50:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,50,6)\">Ps 50:6</ref> = <ref ref=\"Ps 97:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"97\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"97\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,97,6)\">Ps 97:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 89:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,6)\">Ps 89:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 148:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"148\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"148\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,148,4)\">Ps 148:4</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <bdbheb>מְלֶכֶת</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַשּׁ</bdbheb> see <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> p. 573. </p></div><hr><p>I, II. <bdbheb>שַׁמָּה</bdbheb> see  <bdbheb><reflink>שׁמם</reflink></bdbheb>. <bdbheb>שָׂ֫מָּה</bdbheb> see  <bdbheb><reflink>שָׁם</reflink></bdbheb>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Deut 33:28", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 33, "verse": 28}, {"raw": "Gen 1:1", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 1, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Gen 2:4", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 2, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Exod 9:8", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 9, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Deut 10:14", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 10, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Ps 8:4", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 8, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Lev 26:19", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 26, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Hos 2:23", "book": "HOS", "chapter": 2, "verse": 23}, {"raw": "Judg 5:20", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 5, "verse": 20}, {"raw": "Gen 15:5", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 15, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Deut